<title>SWITZERLAND: Coop sets 200 mln Sfr 10-year domestic bond.</title>
<headline>Coop sets 200 mln Sfr 10-year domestic bond.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coop Schweiz, the Swiss retail and grocery chain, said it is launching a domestic bond led by SBC Warburg and Coop Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER = COOP SCHWEIZ    AMT = 200 MLN SFR</p>
<p> COUPON   = 3-3/4 PCT	 MATURITY = 16.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE     = STR		 ISS PRICE = 101-7/8</p>
<p> PAY DATE 16.JUL.97	   SUBSCRPT = 29.JUN.97</p>
<p>HOME CTRY= SWITZERLAND</p>
<p>NOTE - VALOREN NUMBER 655.416 -- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
